# Claude Code — what to share vs keep private
# Commit these (they define your team's agents):
#   .claude/agents/
#   CLAUDE.md
#   .claude/settings.json     ← optional: team defaults

# Ignore these (per-machine, sensitive, or noisy):
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/.credentials*
.claude/projects/
.claude/todos/
.claude/statsig/
.claude/cache/
.claude/logs/
.claude/agents/*-memory/
# Local issue drafts (not for the repo)
.github/.issue-draft-*.md
